WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.300
video file and english subs: Safex

00:00:11.311 --> 00:00:13.792
Despite Candy's caring,

00:00:13.994 --> 00:00:18.752
Mr. McGregor said goodbye to the world
when sleeping.

00:00:31.201 --> 00:00:36.441
White rose of memories

00:00:43.345 --> 00:00:45.724
Mr. McGregor.

00:00:45.993 --> 00:00:50.419
It was only yesterday
that I was by his bedside.

00:01:02.004 --> 00:01:05.776
After his recovery,
we were going to make sandwiches

00:01:05.986 --> 00:01:10.016
and go to the secret lake with Mina.
We made a promise.

00:01:13.005 --> 00:01:14.827
Mr. McGregor.

00:01:17.827 --> 00:01:20.228
Candy, you are here?

00:01:21.114 --> 00:01:23.341
Help us clean the room.

00:01:24.099 --> 00:01:25.569
Clean the room?

00:01:26.179 --> 00:01:28.887
There's gonna be a new patient tomorrow.

00:01:29.969 --> 00:01:31.703
In this special-care ward?

00:01:31.853 --> 00:01:35.736
This time,
it should be less difficult to deal with.

00:01:36.507 --> 00:01:40.290
Natalie, Mr. McGregor
was not difficult to deal with.

00:01:40.736 --> 00:01:42.611
He was a gentle grandfather.

00:01:52.475 --> 00:01:54.042
Mr. McGregor,

00:01:54.723 --> 00:01:58.680
so fast... so sudden....

00:01:59.016 --> 00:02:02.230
Like in deep sleep,

00:02:02.739 --> 00:02:04.649
to a faraway place,

00:02:05.356 --> 00:02:07.528
to be with Anthony.

00:02:10.856 --> 00:02:13.601
The flowers only bloom after they die.

00:02:16.894 --> 00:02:19.447
They die so that
they can dance with the wind.

00:02:19.597 --> 00:02:24.700
And live in people's hearts forever.

00:02:25.983 --> 00:02:28.293
When Anthony died,

00:02:29.405 --> 00:02:31.543
Mr. Albert said to me...

00:02:33.094 --> 00:02:35.198
Don't be sad for his death,

00:02:35.510 --> 00:02:38.758
but be happy for the chance you had
to meet each other.

00:02:44.263 --> 00:02:46.802
I could let go of Anthony's death.

00:02:47.551 --> 00:02:53.487
But why can't I do the same
for Mr. McGregor?

00:02:59.056 --> 00:03:03.710
Why do people suddenly die?

00:03:04.423 --> 00:03:07.968
Why should there be
death and seperation?

00:03:08.313 --> 00:03:11.057
I don't want to see people die anymore.

00:03:13.445 --> 00:03:15.549
That's enough, Candy.

00:03:16.564 --> 00:03:20.509
Sobbing and crying all day
for a patient.

00:03:20.659 --> 00:03:22.259
Franny.

00:03:22.837 --> 00:03:27.697
Candy, do you really think
being a nurse is the right thing for you?

00:03:28.270 --> 00:03:30.408
- Me?
- Yes.

00:03:30.920 --> 00:03:34.265
There are two kinds of patients,

00:03:34.415 --> 00:03:38.732
those who recover, and those who die.

00:03:44.001 --> 00:03:46.368
For a patient who already died, you...

00:03:46.518 --> 00:03:47.622
Franny.

00:03:48.161 --> 00:03:50.299
A nurse can't cry?

00:03:50.844 --> 00:03:52.822
Can't be sad?

00:03:54.399 --> 00:03:57.910
I wouldn't cry for anyone!

00:03:59.564 --> 00:04:00.734
What is she?

00:04:02.583 --> 00:04:04.321
A nurse?

00:04:10.567 --> 00:04:12.373
Nurse.

00:04:13.250 --> 00:04:15.419
It's too tight?

00:04:15.569 --> 00:04:17.937
I can't move.

00:04:18.087 --> 00:04:20.492
Oh no! Sorry!

00:04:33.744 --> 00:04:35.613
Please take it after the meals.

00:04:40.754 --> 00:04:44.574
Nurse, this medicine is for children.

00:04:46.792 --> 00:04:49.136
Sorry, I made a mistake.

00:04:55.914 --> 00:04:57.581
Dim-wit!

00:04:57.731 --> 00:04:59.155
I am sorry.

00:04:59.305 --> 00:05:00.669
Listen!

00:05:00.819 --> 00:05:05.616
Sobbing and crying all day
for a patient

00:05:05.766 --> 00:05:08.016
is not what a nurse should do!

00:05:09.130 --> 00:05:10.365
Yes.

00:05:11.276 --> 00:05:15.597
Mr. McGregor was already announced
incurable when he was sent in here.

00:05:17.281 --> 00:05:20.129
You knew he was going to die?

00:05:21.070 --> 00:05:22.906
He was lucky.

00:05:23.056 --> 00:05:26.996
He died peacefully, without pain.

00:05:30.731 --> 00:05:34.345
You suffer because it is your first time
to lose a patient.

00:05:35.729 --> 00:05:39.205
It is what every nurse will go through.

00:05:39.687 --> 00:05:43.105
Seperation and death.

00:05:47.401 --> 00:05:53.565
What is gone is already gone,
but you can always look ahead.

00:05:54.545 --> 00:05:56.683
There will be more than just one.

00:05:57.866 --> 00:06:01.647
Being depressed all day
for a patient's death

00:06:01.797 --> 00:06:04.079
is distracting for the other patients.

00:06:04.229 --> 00:06:05.784
Got it, dim-wit?

00:06:06.486 --> 00:06:07.584
Yes.

00:06:07.862 --> 00:06:10.640
Then, go back to Pony's Home.

00:06:11.518 --> 00:06:12.849
Headmistress!

00:06:13.059 --> 00:06:17.981
Go home and think about what I said.

00:06:18.131 --> 00:06:21.980
Headmistress,
am I really not good enough for a nurse?

00:06:22.486 --> 00:06:25.486
I want you to take a vacation.

00:06:27.216 --> 00:06:28.415
A vacation?

00:06:28.665 --> 00:06:33.882
Pony will be worried
if you don't go back.

00:06:34.829 --> 00:06:36.228
Headmistress!

00:06:36.978 --> 00:06:39.148
Go home, if you understand what I said.

00:06:40.162 --> 00:06:43.807
You did well, dim-wit.

00:06:43.957 --> 00:06:46.767
Yes, thank you!

00:07:08.438 --> 00:07:13.861
Headmistress Merry Jane is a nice person,
even though she nags a lot.

00:07:17.260 --> 00:07:18.395
That's so cute!

00:07:24.101 --> 00:07:25.771
That's so cute!

00:07:27.087 --> 00:07:30.466
Before I go back to Pony's home,

00:07:30.616 --> 00:07:33.960
I should go to Mr. McGregor's house
to see Mina.

00:07:34.567 --> 00:07:35.871
Let's go!

00:07:41.006 --> 00:07:43.351
Put that chair in the cart over there.

00:07:43.857 --> 00:07:45.023
The one in the front?

00:07:47.312 --> 00:07:48.842
Calm down.

00:07:49.091 --> 00:07:50.657
Mr. Woldo.

00:07:52.713 --> 00:07:54.919
Somebody come teach this dog a lesson.

00:07:55.396 --> 00:07:57.568
No, Mina, be good!

00:07:58.717 --> 00:08:01.599
No, go back!

00:08:13.307 --> 00:08:14.244
Mr. Woldo.

00:08:15.051 --> 00:08:17.121
Get that dog!

00:08:17.635 --> 00:08:19.945
Mina, be good!

00:08:20.787 --> 00:08:21.885
Mina!

00:08:25.047 --> 00:08:28.189
Stop! Get that dog out of here!

00:08:28.339 --> 00:08:30.009
Mina, no!

00:08:31.085 --> 00:08:32.525
Shoot him!

00:08:36.049 --> 00:08:38.221
Is this from Mr. McGregor's house?

00:08:51.948 --> 00:08:53.286
What's happening?

00:08:56.073 --> 00:08:57.475
Here you are again.

00:08:58.025 --> 00:09:02.031
I am a nurse, let me do it.

00:09:02.181 --> 00:09:03.476
Thank you.

00:09:03.926 --> 00:09:07.736
This is not a gun shot.

00:09:07.886 --> 00:09:09.647
Mina did it.

00:09:09.797 --> 00:09:11.492
Mina did it?

00:09:11.642 --> 00:09:18.504
The master said all his properties
would be donated to charity.

00:09:18.654 --> 00:09:21.022
That stupid dog
keeps getting in the way.

00:09:21.272 --> 00:09:25.046
Mina wants
to protect Mr. McGregor's property.

00:09:27.132 --> 00:09:30.082
That supid dog should better die!

00:09:32.700 --> 00:09:34.299
That shot...

00:09:34.449 --> 00:09:37.019
They are trying to kill Mina.

00:09:37.698 --> 00:09:38.967
Mina?

00:09:39.711 --> 00:09:40.806
Mina!

00:09:40.956 --> 00:09:42.517
You haven't treated me.

00:09:42.667 --> 00:09:44.229
It's just a small wound.

00:09:46.318 --> 00:09:48.090
Where did it go?

00:09:48.398 --> 00:09:50.640
That dog is good.

00:09:54.133 --> 00:09:56.775
Mina must be alive.

00:09:59.903 --> 00:10:01.778
Where are you, Mina?

00:10:02.150 --> 00:10:03.516
Come out!

00:10:05.336 --> 00:10:06.811
Mina!

00:10:08.724 --> 00:10:09.822
Mina!

00:10:13.788 --> 00:10:15.389
So cute.

00:10:16.942 --> 00:10:19.389
Where are you, Mina?

00:10:19.994 --> 00:10:21.698
Is it...

00:10:24.422 --> 00:10:26.492
Mina!

00:10:27.407 --> 00:10:29.048
Mina!

00:10:37.838 --> 00:10:39.176
Mina!

00:10:43.708 --> 00:10:45.686
Here you are!

00:10:58.533 --> 00:11:01.987
That's great, you are not hurt!

00:11:06.751 --> 00:11:07.948
Mina.

00:11:08.098 --> 00:11:09.626
Mr. McGregor...

00:11:09.972 --> 00:11:11.572
Mr. McGregor...

00:11:12.856 --> 00:11:17.439
...can't take you here fishing again.

00:11:17.589 --> 00:11:20.833
Mina, I'll be Mr. McGregor for you.

00:11:24.529 --> 00:11:27.204
I will protect you.

00:11:53.978 --> 00:11:55.175
It's morning.

00:11:55.325 --> 00:11:58.196
I fell asleep here last night.

00:11:58.346 --> 00:11:59.871
Thank you, Mina.

00:12:00.418 --> 00:12:03.837
You were protecting me with your body.

00:12:04.207 --> 00:12:06.483
After Mr. McGregor died,

00:12:07.226 --> 00:12:09.468
I had a hard time
falling alseep at night.

00:12:12.392 --> 00:12:15.240
They are still looking for Mina?

00:12:19.738 --> 00:12:21.107
Calm down, Mina.

00:12:25.607 --> 00:12:27.743
We are not bad guys.

00:12:27.993 --> 00:12:29.928
Don't be mad, Mina.

00:12:34.530 --> 00:12:36.767
Somebody is hunting.

00:12:36.917 --> 00:12:39.760
Mina, let's get out of here
as soon as possible.

00:12:44.154 --> 00:12:47.368
Mina, I am taking you with me,
to Pony's Home.

00:12:47.745 --> 00:12:51.290
They have a lot of children there.

00:12:53.883 --> 00:12:58.239
Weird.
Shouldn't there be a road ahead of us?

00:12:59.987 --> 00:13:02.366
We should be there soon.

00:13:02.570 --> 00:13:05.108
Let's ask somebody there.

00:13:25.748 --> 00:13:27.954
Sweet Candy?

00:13:29.404 --> 00:13:31.245
Why are they here?

00:13:31.886 --> 00:13:36.140
Anthony's Sweet Candy.
Why are they here?

00:13:44.598 --> 00:13:45.970
The flowers bloomed.

00:13:46.577 --> 00:13:48.715
The new roses bloomed.

00:13:51.575 --> 00:13:54.056
So beautiful!
It must be a new breed, right?

00:13:54.224 --> 00:13:56.128
What is it called?

00:13:56.278 --> 00:13:57.433
Sweet Candy.

00:13:57.583 --> 00:14:00.890
- Sweet Candy?
- My gift for you.

00:14:01.040 --> 00:14:03.879
Today is your birthday.

00:14:04.723 --> 00:14:06.930
Thank you, Anthony.

00:14:15.087 --> 00:14:17.528
Sweet Candy bloomed.

00:14:17.678 --> 00:14:19.817
Whose home is it?

00:14:21.995 --> 00:14:23.595
Miss Candy.

00:14:25.584 --> 00:14:28.226
Aren't you Miss Candy from the Leagans?

00:14:34.842 --> 00:14:38.017
Mr. Whittman! You are Mr. Whittman!

00:14:38.367 --> 00:14:40.599
These little Candies....

00:14:40.749 --> 00:14:44.185
Yes, Mr. Anthony's babies.

00:14:44.335 --> 00:14:48.015
I want to let more people
see this kind of rose.

00:14:49.330 --> 00:14:50.493
I miss it so much.

00:14:50.643 --> 00:14:53.243
Miss Candy hasn't changed at all.

00:14:54.228 --> 00:14:56.165
Don't call me Miss Candy.

00:14:56.315 --> 00:14:58.151
I am a practice nurse now.

00:15:00.231 --> 00:15:02.678
What did the Adleys say?

00:15:04.457 --> 00:15:07.204
Is Mr. Whittman working here?

00:15:07.354 --> 00:15:12.027
Yes, I am a gardener here.

00:15:12.177 --> 00:15:15.214
The master here likes roses very much.

00:15:15.962 --> 00:15:18.135
He must be a gentle person.

00:15:18.545 --> 00:15:20.089
Like Anthony.

00:15:25.119 --> 00:15:27.189
It's that dog again.

00:15:29.312 --> 00:15:33.527
Come in, the master is almost awake.

00:15:33.677 --> 00:15:35.338
Mina, let's go!

00:15:35.488 --> 00:15:37.290
Master?

00:15:39.475 --> 00:15:40.671
It's you?

00:15:40.821 --> 00:15:43.937
You hid the dog. Get off!

00:15:47.259 --> 00:15:49.057
- Don't kill Mina!
- Master!

00:15:50.711 --> 00:15:52.847
It hurt me like this.

00:15:52.997 --> 00:15:55.026
I can't forgive her.

00:15:55.176 --> 00:15:59.565
Mina was just trying
to protect Mr. McGregor's property.

00:15:59.768 --> 00:16:01.818
Get off! Can't you understand?

00:16:01.968 --> 00:16:05.361
I am gonna kill this dog!

00:16:05.511 --> 00:16:06.670
Get off!

00:16:13.353 --> 00:16:14.793
Mina. No!

00:16:14.995 --> 00:16:18.003
Let me go! Get it away from here!

00:16:19.054 --> 00:16:20.251
Mr. Whittman.

00:16:20.401 --> 00:16:22.100
Miss Candy, go.

00:16:23.045 --> 00:16:24.677
Mina, that's enough!

00:16:24.827 --> 00:16:26.156
Come here.

00:16:26.306 --> 00:16:27.496
Whittman, why didn't you shoot?

00:16:27.646 --> 00:16:32.536
Master, if we shoot here,
Sweet Candy will cry.

00:16:33.611 --> 00:16:35.613
The roses?

00:16:36.663 --> 00:16:39.036
This is Miss Candy.

00:16:39.186 --> 00:16:40.517
Candy?

00:16:40.923 --> 00:16:47.866
Mr. Anthony named the roses
after her name before he died.

00:16:50.919 --> 00:16:53.023
After your name?

00:16:53.736 --> 00:16:58.631
If you really like roses,
please forgive Mina.

00:17:02.356 --> 00:17:03.757
Master.

00:17:03.907 --> 00:17:05.307
Thank you!

00:17:07.756 --> 00:17:12.719
Mina, Anthony saved your life.

00:17:13.459 --> 00:17:15.906
Mr. Anthony's heart...

00:17:16.175 --> 00:17:19.857
...is still
living in the white rose garden.

00:17:38.011 --> 00:17:39.990
Thank you.

00:17:49.516 --> 00:17:51.689
Kurin, I'm back!

00:17:54.614 --> 00:17:58.228
Kurin. She's a new friend.
Her name is Mina.

00:18:01.624 --> 00:18:03.031
Come here.

00:18:03.604 --> 00:18:07.652
Mina is too big! Kurin is frightened!

00:18:09.339 --> 00:18:11.111
Be good friends.

00:18:14.806 --> 00:18:17.253
Boss!

00:18:18.496 --> 00:18:20.669
Boss!

00:18:21.179 --> 00:18:22.746
Jimmy.

00:18:23.795 --> 00:18:25.258
Welcome back, Boss!

00:18:25.408 --> 00:18:26.870
I am back, Jimmy!

00:18:32.718 --> 00:18:35.356
Candy is back, really?

00:18:35.506 --> 00:18:37.204
Where is Candy?

00:18:40.130 --> 00:18:42.268
Candy!

00:18:42.813 --> 00:18:45.387
Candy! Where are you?

00:18:47.844 --> 00:18:51.024
Sister Pony, I'm back!

00:18:52.172 --> 00:18:53.606
Candy!

00:18:53.756 --> 00:18:56.357
Did I change, sister?

00:18:56.935 --> 00:19:00.892
A naughty girl is always naughty.
And Jimmy too!

00:19:05.186 --> 00:19:08.260
Sister Pony, this is Mina.

00:19:08.410 --> 00:19:11.446
Can we keep her here?

00:19:11.596 --> 00:19:13.932
She's too big.

00:19:14.082 --> 00:19:17.822
Her master died,
so she's all by herself now.

00:19:17.972 --> 00:19:21.175
I will take care of the spending
each month.

00:19:21.325 --> 00:19:24.136
I'll help too, Boss.

00:19:25.311 --> 00:19:28.724
No problem, come down!

00:19:28.874 --> 00:19:32.251
Ok, Mina, let's go down.

00:19:32.992 --> 00:19:34.628
They are my followers.

00:19:34.870 --> 00:19:39.764
That's right. We can help you up,
but you need to go down by yourself.

00:19:42.081 --> 00:19:43.717
What's wrong, Mina?

00:19:43.926 --> 00:19:45.836
Are you afraid, Mina?

00:19:46.241 --> 00:19:50.289
Sister Pony, we are coming down!

00:19:50.970 --> 00:19:53.211
Please catch us.

00:19:57.779 --> 00:19:59.889
No!

00:20:14.650 --> 00:20:16.819
Candy. Come on.

00:20:16.969 --> 00:20:20.979
Mina, you are too heavy.

00:20:24.512 --> 00:20:27.688
I know all your things.

00:20:30.348 --> 00:20:32.851
Candy, come down!

00:20:33.001 --> 00:20:35.503
OK, I am coming!

00:20:41.753 --> 00:20:42.711
Great!

00:20:42.861 --> 00:20:46.576
You are back, tomboy!

00:20:46.951 --> 00:20:49.455
No wonder you are the boss.
You are so cool!

00:20:54.129 --> 00:20:57.171
Mina is back to normal, too.

00:20:58.657 --> 00:21:00.132
Come, Kurin.

00:21:05.063 --> 00:21:12.669
The sad feeling in Candy's heart
is gradually going away,

00:21:13.248 --> 00:21:19.778
thanks to headmistress's thoughtfulness.
